  "description": "The proposed works involve the internal fit-out of a sauna and cold plunge facility within the existing building. The layout will comprise two saunas (one large and one small), a shower room, two WCs, a reception area, and changing rooms. The existing interior is a clean, open space, and no alterations or demolition works to the original structure are proposed. All new elements will be freestanding and installed on the existing concrete slab, ensuring that no fixings or attachments are made to the original arch or historic fabric of the building. Plumbing and drainage will connect to the existing foul drainage system on site, and a new gas meter will be installed on the existing live gas main. All works will be minimally invasive and fully reversible, preserving the integrity and character of the listed building."
